include CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md CONTRIBUTING.md LICENSE NOTICE README.md SECURITY.md VALIDATION.md
include uv.lock
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include examples *.json *.txt
